---
// How a job works: the five steps of a job, in Jo's own words and voice, as Jo supplied
// them. Pricing is per word (BRIEF.md); the file format sentence is Jo's own fact.
// The photo was supplied as desk.jpg but shows a floor plan; the alt says what it shows.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="How a job works"
  description="How a translation job works, step by step: you send the documents, get a fixed price per word, agree the terminology, and get the files back in your format."
  image="/images/og/how-a-job-works.jpg">
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <h1>How a job works</h1>
    <img
      class="photo"
      src="/images/how-a-job-works/desk-800.webp"
      srcset="/images/how-a-job-works/desk-480.webp 480w, /images/how-a-job-works/desk-800.webp 800w, /images/how-a-job-works/desk-1200.webp 1200w"
      sizes="(min-width: 42.5rem) 40rem, calc(100vw - 2.5rem)"
      width="1200"
      height="791"
      alt="An old blueprint of a building's main floor, with rooms labelled in Dutch"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      decoding="async" />
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <strong>You send the documents.</strong> Email me the files and, if you have one,
        your terminology list. Tell me when you need the translation.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>You get a fixed price.</strong> I price the job per word and send you the
        price before any work starts. It does not change.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>We agree the terminology.</strong> If you have no terminology list, I build
        one with you on the first job and keep it for every later job.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>I translate and check.</strong> I translate the documents, then check every
        part name against your terminology list.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>You get the files back.</strong> In the format you sent them.
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p>Which documents I translate is on the page <a href="/services">my services</a>.</p>
    <p class="cta">
      <a class="button" href="/contact">Ask for a fixed price</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .photo { display: block; width: 40rem; margin-top: 1rem; border-radius: 6px; }
</style>
